</sp> <sp who="#MOR"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Mortimer</hi></speaker> <stage>(ausfor&#x017F;chend).</stage><lb/>
<p>Dann wa&#x0364;re wohl das Be&#x017F;te &#x2014;</p><lb/>
</sp> <sp who="#ELI"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Eli&#x017F;abeth</hi></speaker> <stage>(&#x017F;chnell).</stage><lb/>
<p>Freilich wa&#x0364;r's<lb/>
Das Be&#x017F;te &#x2014; O mein guter Engel &#x017F;pricht<lb/>
