<stage>(Sie geht ab.)</stage></sp></div><lb/>
<pb n="91" facs="#f0097"/>
<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#g">Sechster Auftritt</hi>.</head><lb/>
<sp who="#MOR"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Mortimer</hi></speaker><stage>allein.</stage><lb/>
<p>Geh', fal&#x017F;che, gleißneri&#x017F;che Ko&#x0364;nigin!<lb/>
