</sp> <sp who="#OKE"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Okelly</hi></speaker> <stage>(herein&#x017F;tu&#x0364;rzend).</stage><lb/>
<p>Flieht, Mortimer! Flieht. Alles i&#x017F;t verloren.</p><lb/>
</sp> <sp who="#MOR"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Mortimer</hi>.</speaker><lb/>
<p>Was i&#x017F;t verloren?</p><lb/>
</sp>
<pb n="148" facs="#f0154"/>
<sp who="#OKE"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Okelly</hi>.</speaker><lb/>
