</sp> <sp who="#MOR"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Mortimer</hi>.</speaker><lb/>
<p>Sie lebt!</p><lb/>
</sp> <sp who="#OKE"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Okelly</hi>.</speaker><lb/>
<p>Lebt, um uns alle zu verderben!<lb/>
Kommt, man umzingelt &#x017F;chon den Park.</p><lb/>
</sp> <sp who="#MOR"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Mortimer</hi>.</speaker><lb/>
<p>Wer hat<lb/>
