<sp who="#AUBGRA"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Aube&#x017F;pine</hi>.</speaker><lb/>
<p><hi rendition="#in">W</hi>ie &#x017F;teht's um Ihro Maje&#x017F;ta&#x0364;t? Milords,<lb/>
