</sp> <sp who="#DAV"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Davi&#x017F;on</hi>.</speaker><lb/>
<p>Es &#x017F;oll ge&#x017F;chehn.</p><lb/>
<stage>(Geht ab.)</stage><lb/>
</sp> <sp who="#AUBGRA"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Aube&#x017F;pine</hi></speaker> <stage>(Burleigh entgegen).</stage><lb/>
<p>Milord, mein treues Herz<lb/>
