</sp> <sp who="#BURL"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Burleigh</hi>.</speaker><lb/>
<p>Bemu&#x0364;ht euch nicht, Graf Aube&#x017F;pine.</p><lb/>
</sp> <sp who="#AUBGRA"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Aube&#x017F;pine</hi></speaker> <stage>(offizios).</stage><lb/>
<p>Ich weiß,<lb/>
